{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわ～(#^.^#)\nろってぃーだよ.まにだよ."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バナナで「もしも～し❤️？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/01/08/8680357/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんとバナナで電話してみた.＊わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年貼らなかった写真を貼ろうと思ってさ...。\n貼りまーす。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななせと."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/01/08/8680357/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人増えて ゆうりも."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/01/08/8680357/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"も1人増えて らりんも."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/01/08/8680357/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またまた増えて あすかも."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/01/08/8680357/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真撮ってたら皆はいってきてくれる(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう❤️.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前 珍しくポニーテールしたの。\nでもね、やっぱおろしてる方が今はしっくりくるの（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは Xmasライブの時にも使った衣装だよん。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/01/08/8680357/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ～～～。\nそういやね、昨日は久々にディズニーに行ってきましたよ❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろ,あみ,ちはる,かずみ,まあやの5人で！\n川後はちょっと今回は不参加（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ皆には言ってなかったんだけどね、\nチームD＋まあやで 「チーム チューリップ」になるの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何でチューリップな～ん？？？\nってなるよねっ、、、笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっとそれはね、特にないんですけど、まあやがチューリップ好きだしチューリップ可愛いから。っていうどーでもいい理由。わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろ❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また更新します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/01/08/8680357/0006.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}